                                      | kernel can    -0.99825    0.0017          4.71   residual matter 117.6x less than Newtonian
                                      | kernel alt    -0.99875    0.0012          5.09   residual matter 164.8x less than Newtonian
        12   -3.283715e-02     -2.613 |  Newtonian    -0.79470    0.2053           nan
                                      | kernel can    -0.99649    0.0035          3.96   residual matter 58.6x less than Newtonian
                                      | kernel alt    -0.99744    0.0026          4.29   residual matter 80.2x less than Newtonian
        15   -3.283715e-02     -2.613 |  Newtonian    -0.79470    0.2053           nan
